### AC1: Latest Achievements Retrieval without Size Parameter (Required)
# Tests: Valid JWT token, missing required 'size' query parameter
# Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request with validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC2: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Small (SM) Size Type
# Tests: Small DTO projection with abbreviated fields
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with achievements in SM format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=sm
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC2: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Extra Small (XS) Size Type
# Tests: Extra small DTO projection with minimal fields
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with achievements in XS format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=xs
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC2: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Medium (MD) Size Type (explicit)
# Tests: Medium DTO projection with standard fields
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with achievements in MD format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=md
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC3: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Large (LG) Size Type
# Tests: Large DTO projection with comprehensive fields including counts
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with achievements in LG format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=lg
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC3: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Extra Large (XL) Size Type
# Tests: Extra large DTO projection with all available fields
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with achievements in XL format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=xl
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC4: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Custom Limit (5)
# Tests: Limit parameter to retrieve only 5 achievements
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with maximum 5 achievements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC4: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Custom Limit (20)
# Tests: Limit parameter to retrieve 20 achievements
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with maximum 20 achievements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC4: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Limit 1
# Tests: Single achievement retrieval
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with exactly 1 achievement
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC5: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Date Filter (Recent)
# Tests: Date filter to get achievements from January 10, 2025 onwards
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with filtered achievements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?fromDate=2025-01-10T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC5: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Date Filter (Last Month)
# Tests: Date filter to get achievements from last month
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with filtered achievements from last month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?fromDate=2024-12-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC6: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Combined Parameters (LG + Limit + Date)
# Tests: All parameters combined - LG size, limit 20, date filter
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with up to 20 achievements in LG format from specified date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=lg&limit=20&fromDate=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC6: Retrieve Latest Achievements with Combined Parameters (SM + Limit + Date)
# Tests: All parameters combined - SM size, limit 5, date filter
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with up to 5 achievements in SM format from specified date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=sm&limit=5&fromDate=2024-12-15T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC7: No Achievements Found (Empty Result with Future Date Filter)
# Tests: Query with date filter that returns no results
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with empty array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?fromDate=2025-12-31T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC8: Authentication Failure - Missing JWT Token
# Tests: Request without JWT token
# Expected: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC9: Authentication Failure - Invalid JWT Token
# Tests: Request with invalid JWT token
# Expected: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest
Authorization: Bearer INVALID_TOKEN_123
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC10: Validation Failure - Future Date Filter
# Tests: Date filter with future date (should fail validation)
# Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request with validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?fromDate=2026-12-31T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC11: Validation Failure - Negative Limit Value
# Tests: Invalid negative limit value
# Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request with validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?limit=-5
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC11: Validation Failure - Zero Limit Value
# Tests: Invalid zero limit value
# Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request with validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0

### AC: Invalid Size Type Parameter
# Tests: Invalid size type value
# Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request with validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/achievement/latest?size=INVALID
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0
